cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  Cite the exact paper release rather than the moving repository whenever a
  paper-specific DOI or release tag is available.
title: N Human-AI Mathematics
type: software
version: 0.1.0-public-review
date-released: 2026-07-27
authors:
  - family-names: Novak
    given-names: Matthew S.
abstract: >-
  A public-review repository for human-led, LLM-assisted mathematical
  research. It contains precise candidate theorem statements, proofs,
  formal-verification status, reproducible computational evidence, correction
  records, prior-art boundaries, human-LLM role disclosures, and structured
  adversarial-review materials. Public visibility does not imply peer review,
  worldwide novelty, identification of a specific model or provider, or
  complete formal verification.
repository-code: https://github.com/novakprotocol/N-Human-AI-Mathematics
url: https://github.com/novakprotocol/N-Human-AI-Mathematics
keywords:
  - mathematics
  - formal verification
  - reproducibility
  - human-AI collaboration
  - LLM-assisted research
  - theorem review
  - computational mathematics
